   * `Notify me when a service changes status': Will display a balloon
     notification from the taskbar when a monitored service changes its
     status.

FIGURE GOES HERE: MySQL Notifier for Microsoft Windows Options menu

The `Actions', `Manage Monitored Items' menu enables you to configure
