3.6.3 Maximum of Column per Group
---------------------------------

_Task: Find the highest price per article._

     SELECT article, MAX(price) AS price
     FROM   shop
     GROUP BY article;

     +---------+-------+
     | article | price |
     +---------+-------+
     |    0001 |  3.99 |
     |    0002 | 10.99 |
     |    0003 |  1.69 |
     |    0004 | 19.95 |
     +---------+-------+


