                        the server should use when    
                        listening for local           
                        connections                   
-syslog     syslog      Write error messages to       
                        syslog                        
-syslog-tag=tagsyslog-tag  Tag suffix for messages       
                        written to syslog             
-timezone=timezonetimezone    Set the TZ time zone          
                        environment variable to the   
                        given option value            
