   *  `--super-large-pages'

     Options for super-large-pages

     *Introduced*         5.5.3           
     *Command-Line        `--super-large-pages'        
     Format*                              
     *Option-File Format* `super-large-pages'        
     *Platform Specific*  solaris         
                          *Permitted        
                          Values*         
