   *  `rpl_semi_sync_master_trace_level'

     Options for rpl_semi_sync_master_trace_level

     *System Variable     `rpl_semi_sync_master_trace_level'        
     Name*                                
     *Variable Scope*     Global          
     *Dynamic Variable*   Yes             
                          *Permitted        
                          Values*         
