     This variable controls whether `InnoDB' mutexes are timed. If this
     variable is set to 0 or `OFF' (the default), mutex timing is
     disabled. If the variable is set to 1 or `ON', mutex timing is
     enabled. With timing enabled, the `os_wait_times' value in the
     output from *Note `SHOW ENGINE INNODB MUTEX': show-engine.
