     actual limit is determined as the minimum of `tmp_table_size' and
     `max_heap_table_size'.) If an in-memory temporary table exceeds
     the limit, MySQL automatically converts it to an on-disk `MyISAM'
     table. Increase the value of `tmp_table_size' (and
     `max_heap_table_size' if necessary) if you do many advanced `GROUP
