13.7.5.10 `SHOW CREATE FUNCTION' Syntax
.......................................

     SHOW CREATE FUNCTION FUNC_NAME

This statement is similar to *Note `SHOW CREATE PROCEDURE':
show-create-procedure. but for stored functions. See *Note
show-create-procedure::.


