   *  `innodb_file_format_check'

     Options for innodb_file_format_check

     *Command-Line        `--innodb_file_format_check=#'        
     Format*                              
     *Option-File Format* `innodb_file_format_check'        
     *System Variable     `innodb_file_format_check'        
     Name*                                
