     BACKGROUND THREAD
     ----------
     srv_master_thread loops: 53 1_second, 44 sleeps, 5 10_second, 7 background,
       7 flush
     srv_master_thread log flush and writes: 48
     ----------
     SEMAPHORES
     ----------
