*B-tree indexes* Yes      *T-tree indexes* No       *Hash indexes*   Yes
*Full-text       No       *Clustered       No       *Data caches*    N/A
search indexes*           indexes*                                   
*Index caches*   N/A      *Compressed      No       *Encrypted data  Yes
                          data*                     Implemented in   
                                                    the server (via  
                                                    encryption       
                                                    functions),      
                                                    rather than in   
                                                    the storage      
                                                    engine.*         
*Cluster         No       *Replication     Yes      *Foreign key     No
database                  support                   support*         
support*                  Implemented in                             
                          the server,                                
                          rather than in                             
