   *  `ShmSize'

     This table provides type and value information for the ShmSize
     shared memory configuration parameter

     Effective Version Type/Units        Default           Range/Values
     NDB 7.2.0         bytes             1M                64K - 4G
     *Restart Type:* N                                     

