     epoch.

     For more information, see *Note mysql-cluster-replication-schema::.

   *  `--ndb-log-transaction-id'

     Options for ndb-log-transaction-id

     *Introduced*         5.5.15-ndb-7.2.1        
     *Command-Line        `--ndb-log-transaction-id[={0|1}]'        
