   *  `ndb_log_transaction_id'

     Options for ndb_log_transaction_id

     *Introduced*         5.5.15-ndb-7.2.1        
     *System Variable     `ndb_log_transaction_id'        
     Name*                                
     *Variable Scope*     Global          
     *Dynamic Variable*   No              
