17.4.8 `ndb_cpcd' -- Automate Testing for NDB Development
---------------------------------------------------------

A utility having this name was formerly part of an internal automated
test framework used in testing and debugging MySQL Cluster. It was
deprecated in MySQL Cluster NDB 7.0, and removed from MySQL Cluster
distributions provided by Oracle beginning with MySQL Cluster NDB 7.2.1.


