     | BLACKHOLE                        | ACTIVE | STORAGE ENGINE     | NULL    | GPL     |
     | ARCHIVE                          | ACTIVE | STORAGE ENGINE     | NULL    | GPL     |
     | ndbcluster                       | ACTIVE | STORAGE ENGINE     | NULL    | GPL     |
     _| ndbinfo                          | ACTIVE | STORAGE ENGINE     | NULL    | GPL     |_
