`transporters' table. For each column, the table shows the name, data
type, and a brief description.  Additional information can be found in
the notes following the table.

This table provides information about the columns in the `transporters'
table. The table shows the column name, data type, and provides a brief
description.

Column Name            Type               Description
`node_id'              integer            This data node's unique node ID
                                          in the cluster.
`remote_node_id'       integer            The remote data node's node ID.
`status'               string             Status of the connection.
`remote_address'       string             Name or IP address of the
                                          remote host
`bytes_sent'           integer            Number of bytes sent using this
                                          connection
`bytes_received'                          Number of bytes received using
                                          this connection
