20.1 The `INFORMATION_SCHEMA CHARACTER_SETS' Table
==================================================

The *Note `CHARACTER_SETS': character-sets-table. table provides
information about available character sets.

This table describes the `INFORMATION_SCHEMA' *Note `CHARACTER_SETS':
character-sets-table. table.

`INFORMATION_SCHEMA' Name     *Note `SHOW': show.    Remarks
                              Name                   
