        specified by
        the
        `innodb_concurrency_tickets'
        option.
`TRX_ISOLATION_LEVEL'The isolation
        level of the
        current
        transaction.
`TRX_UNIQUE_CHECKS'Whether
        unique checks
        are turned on
        or off for
        the current
