22.2.3.18 MySQL SQL Editor
..........................

MySQL Connector/Net 6.3.2 introduced a new MySQL SQL Editor. The
easiest way to invoke the editor is by selecting the `New', `File' menu
item from the Visual Studio main menu. This displays the `New File'
