22.2.10 Connector/Net Support
-----------------------------

* Menu:

* connector-net-support-community::  Connector/Net Community Support
* connector-net-support-bug-report::  How to Report Connector/Net Problems or Bugs

The developers of Connector/Net greatly value the input of our users in
the software development process. If you find Connector/Net lacking
some feature important to you, or if you discover a bug and need to
file a bug report, please use the instructions in *Note bug-reports::.


