22.4.3.2 Building MySQL Connector/C++ from Source on Windows
............................................................

*Note*:

The only compiler formally supported for Windows is Microsoft Visual
Studio 2003 and above.

The basic steps for building the connector on Windows are the same as
for Unix. It is important to use `CMake' 2.6.2 or newer to generate
