--------------------------------

The MySQL Connector/Python 1.1 is the current development series.

The MySQL Connector/Python 1.0 series went through a series of beta
releases, leading to the first generally available (GA) version of
1.0.7. Any development releases prior to the GA version (1.0.7) are no
longer supported.

