22.6.8.2 Method `mysql.connector.connect()'
...........................................

This method sets up a connection, establishing a session with the MySQL
server. If no arguments are given, it uses the already configured or
default values. For a complete list of possible arguments, see *Note
connector-python-connectargs::.

