`mysql.connector.connect()' method or the
`mysql.connector.MySQLConnection()' class:

     cnx = mysql.connector.connect(user='joe', database='test')
     cnx = MySQLConnection(user='joe', database='test')

For descriptions of connection methods and properties, see *Note
connector-python-api-mysqlconnection::.


