This function requires that the result set structure contains the
entire result of the query, so *Note `mysql_data_seek()':
mysql-data-seek. may be used only in conjunction with *Note
`mysql_store_result()': mysql-store-result, not with *Note
`mysql_use_result()': mysql-use-result.

* Return Values *

None.

* Errors *

None.


