22.9.2.30 Requirements
......................

Copyright 1997-2012 the PHP Documentation Group.

`PHP 5.3.6' or newer. Some advanced functionality requires `PHP 5.4.0'
or newer.

The `mysqlnd_ms' replication and load balancing plugin supports all PHP
applications and all available PHP MySQL extensions (mysqli, mysql, See
section "apis-php-ref.pdo-mysql" in the online manual). The PHP MySQL
extension must be configured to use See section "apis-php-mysqli" in
the online manual in order to be able to use the `mysqlnd_ms' plugin for
See section "apis-php-mysqli" in the online manual.


