        the following. It is not guaranteed whether the    
        statement will be executed on a slave or not.      
        This is how often the internal `is_select'         
        function has guessed that a master shall be used.  
        Please, see also the user space function *Note     
        `mysqlnd_ms_query_is_select':                      
        apis-php-function.mysqlnd-ms-query-is-select.      
`use_slave_sql_hint'Number of statements sent to a slave because       Since 1.0.0.
        statement begins with the SQL hint to force use    
        of slave.                                          
`use_master_sql_hint'Number of statements sent to a master because      Since 1.0.0.
        statement begins with the SQL hint to force use    
