Feature changes

   * APC storage handler update

        * Fix build for APC 3.1.9+

        * Note: Use of the APC storage handler is currently not
          recommended due to stability issues of APC itself.

   * New PHP configuration directives

        * ` mysqlnd_qc.collect_statistics_log_file'. Aggregated cache
          statistics log file written after every 10th request served
          by the PHP process.

