        * MYSQLND_QC_SERVER_ID_SWITCH allows grouping of cache entries
          from different physical connections. This is needed by
          PECL/mysqlnd_ms.

        * MYSQLND_QC_CONDITION_META_SCHEMA_PATTERN to be used with
