22.9.6.8 Requirements
.....................

Copyright 1997-2012 the PHP Documentation Group.

PHP: this extension requires PHP 5.4+, version PHP 5.4.4 or never. The
required PHP extensions are PCRE (http://www.php.net/ref.pcre) (enabled
by default), and the memcached (http://www.php.net/book.memcached)
extension version 2.0.x.

The `mysqlnd_memcache' Memcache plugin supports all PHP applications
and all available PHP MySQL extensions (mysqli, mysql, See section
"apis-php-ref.pdo-mysql" in the online manual). The PHP MySQL extension
must be configured with See section "apis-php-mysqli" in the online
manual support.

For accessing `InnoDB' tables, this PHP extension requires `MySQL
Server 5.6.6' or newer with the InnoDB Memcache Daemon Plugin enabled.

For accessing `MySQL Cluster NDB' tables, this PHP extension requires
`MySQL Cluster 7.2' or newer with the NDB Memcache API nodes enabled.


