22.11 MySQL Python API
======================

`MySQLdb' is a third-party driver that provides MySQL support for
Python, compliant with the Python DB API version 2.0. It can be found at
`http://sourceforge.net/projects/mysql-python/'.

The new MySQL Connector/Python component provides an interface to the
same Python API, and is built into the MySQL Server and supported by
Oracle. See *Note connector-python:: for details on the Connector, as
well as coding guidelines for Python applications and sample Python
code.


