22.14 MySQL Eiffel Wrapper
==========================

Eiffel MySQL is an interface to the MySQL database server using the
Eiffel programming language
(http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eiffel_(programming_language)), written
by Michael Ravits. It can be found at
`http://efsa.sourceforge.net/archive/ravits/mysql.htm'.


